{"path":"memory/unique_ptr/operator_ltlt","title":"std::unique_ptr<T,Deleter>::operator<<","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::unique_ptr&lt;T,Deleter&gt;::</span>operator&lt;&lt;","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/operator_ltlt","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts the value of the pointer managed by p into the output stream os.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Y, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> D <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\"><span class=\"kw737\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Y, D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> p <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts the value of the pointer managed by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> into the output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>.\n</p><p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is a valid expression.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span> to insert <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">p</span></code> into\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> p\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the pointer to be inserted into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\"><span class=\"kw737\">std::<span class=\"me2\">unique_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Y, D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">pointer</span></span></code> is a pointer to a character type (e.g., when <code>Y</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>(<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code>) or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">CharT</span></code>(<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code>)), this may end up calling the <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/operator_ltlt2\">overloads of <code>operator&lt;&lt;</code> for null-terminated character strings</a> (causing undefined behavior if the pointer does not in fact point to such a string), rather than <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream/operator_ltlt\">the overload for printing the value of the pointer itself</a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Foo <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/make_unique\"><span class=\"kw739\">std::<span class=\"me2\">make_unique</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>Foo<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> p.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>0x6d9028\n0x6d9028</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/get\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>get</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a pointer to the managed object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/unique_ptr","title":"std::unique_ptr"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::unique_ptr<T,Deleter>::operator<<","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Inserts the value of the pointer managed by p into the output stream os."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"os, p"},{"label":"Return value","note":"os"},{"label":"Notes","note":"If std::unique_ptr<Y, D>::pointer is a pointer to a character type (e.g., when Y is char([]) or CharT([])), this may end up calling the overloads of…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"get","note":"returns a pointer to the managed object"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":178,"codeBlockCount":2}
